Project Description: A web service for talent solutions, and you will work for the Data Management team responsible for handling various data-related tasks. The team maintains and governs data, providing solutions for processing, integration, and data services. They collaborate with the infrastructure/platform team to deploy AWS services and manage relationships with vendors to maintain managed services.
- Responsible for deploying and maintaining the data platform, in terms of auth of DBMS, data processing or access tools, applications and frameworks, such as batch and stream jobs on an ETL framework, metadata management tools, BI tools, AWS resources for hosting those tools, etc.
- Collaborate closely with data platform software engineers and our infrastructure/platform squad that maintains the entire infrastructure.
- More than 5 years of working experience as a SRE/ DevOps Engineer, and it would be a plus if you have experience with data platform; 
- Familiar with AWS, especially IAM, ECS, EKS, Lambda, RDS, CloudWatch (rich experience on AWS is a must; GCP or Azure experience is a plus);
- Rich experience in deploying containerized applications/services and very familiar with operations on Kubernetes;
- Rich experience in infra-as-code, familiar with IT automation systems like Scalr, Terraform or its alternatives, proficient in configuring and maintaining CI/CD flows (experience with ArgoCD is a plus);
- Good understanding of cloud architecture and infrastructure, and can design and maintain/handle the SLA/SLO, HA/DR of services;
- Good knowledge of cloud security, familiarity with SSO (experience with Auth0, Azure AD, Okta, etc.), authentication/ authorization mechanisms like SAML/OIDC, and OAuth;
- Experience in deploying, integrating and maintaining data processing and ML frameworks like Airflow, Puppet, Metabase, Databricks, Snowflake, Metaflow, MLflow, etc is a plus.

- Thiết kế và phát triển các mô-đun cốt lõi phía server của trò chơi, bao gồm logic game, hệ thống chiến đấu, hệ thống xã hội,...
- Xây dựng và tối ưu hóa kiến trúc truyền thông mạng phía server, đảm bảo hoạt động ổn định trong điều kiện người chơi đồng thời cao;
- Hợp tác chặt chẽ với các nhóm client, thiết kế và đồ họa để triển khai tính năng và cập nhật phiên bản;
- Tham gia xử lý sự cố và tối ưu hiệu suất server, đảm bảo an toàn, ổn định và khả năng mở rộng của hệ thống;
